{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n5-911":{"renderings":[{"id":"e412b0cba68bfbf5","role":"label","field":"name","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-911"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Plain"},{"id":"839cbaf45560168b","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-911"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"The plain copula. な-adjectives are noun-like: they take だ rather than inflecting."},{"id":"0492994897c79bfc","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-911"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"な-adjectives do not conjugate themselves; they attach the copula だ, exactly as a noun does. Learning the copula here therefore also covers noun + copula (学生だ)."},{"id":"a64d66e0de4ef80d","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-911"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"な-Adjective / Noun + だ: 静かだ, 学生だ."},{"id":"93886bc9c27252e3","role":"label","field":"derives","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-911"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"plain (だ)"}]}}}